---
// CTA.astro
---

<section class="relative bg-zinc-950 text-white py-24 md:py-32 overflow-hidden border-t border-zinc-800">
  <!-- Subtle eye-soothing dark mode background glow -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">

    <!-- Urgency/Status Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 mb-6 shadow-sm">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      Limited Slots Available for Q4 Projects
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
      Ready to Turn Your Website Into a <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-blue-400">Lead-Generating Asset?</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
      Get a free website audit today and discover precisely what is stopping your business site from converting casual traffic into real enquiries.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/919352563337"
        target="_blank"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 text-zinc-950 px-8 py-4 font-bold hover:bg-emerald-400 transition shadow-xl shadow-emerald-500/20 group text-base"
      >
        Get My Free Audit on WhatsApp
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" style="color: #09090b;" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-500 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      No pressure. No long-term contracts. Just a clear roadmap to scale your business.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>